@startuml 01_arsitektur_global_dan_aliran_data
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBorderColor #CCCCCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0

title Diagram Arsitektur Global & Alur REST API Terpadu

box "Frontend Publik (portofolio-web :3000)" #F8F9FA
    actor "Pengunjung\n(Public Visitor)" as User
    participant "portofolio-web\n(Next.js 16)" as Web
    participant "Contact API Route\n/api/contact" as ContactAPI
end box

box "Backend & Database Cloud (Supabase)" #EEF2FF
    participant "Express.js REST API\n(Port 5000)" as ExpressBackend
    participant "Supabase Storage\n(portfolio-assets)" as StorageAPI
    database "PostgreSQL DB\n(projects, skills, ...)" as DB
    participant "Supabase Realtime\n(WebSocket Server)" as Realtime
end box

box "Admin CMS (portofolio-admin :3001)" #F0FDF4
    actor "Firman\n(Admin)" as Admin
    participant "portofolio-admin\n(Dashboard UI)" as AdminApp
    participant "Admin API Route\n/api/upload & auth" as AdminAPI
end box

box "External API" #FEF3C7
    participant "GitHub API v3\n(api.github.com)" as GitHubAPI
end box

== 1. Pengunjung Mengakses Website Portofolio ==
User -> Web: Buka website (/)
activate Web
Web -> DB: GET /projects, /profile, /skills, /experiences\n(withTimeout 3500ms safety fallback)
activate DB
DB --> Web: Return dataset aktif (Status 200 OK)
deactivate DB
Web -> Realtime: Subscribe channel realtime WebSocket (postgres_changes)
Web --> User: Render UI interaktif, bio, tech stack, dan kartu proyek
deactivate Web

== 2. Pengunjung Mengirim Formulir Kontak (REST API) ==
User -> Web: Isi form kontak & klik "Kirim Pesan"
activate Web
Web -> ContactAPI: POST /api/contact\n{name, email, subject, message, botField}
activate ContactAPI
note over ContactAPI: - Validasi regex email RFC\n- Rate Limit: Maks 4 pesan per 10 menit per IP\n- Honeypot check: botField harus kosong
ContactAPI -> DB: INSERT into "messages" (name, email, message, read: false)
activate DB
DB --> ContactAPI: Status 201 Created
deactivate DB
ContactAPI --> Web: Response JSON {success: true}\n(Status 200 OK)
deactivate ContactAPI
Web --> User: Tampilkan feedback sukses & efek animasi Confetti
Realtime -->> AdminApp: Broadcast event pesan baru (Badge Inbox +1)
deactivate Web

== 3. Autentikasi Pengelola CMS (Admin Session) ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Masukkan password admin & submit
activate AdminApp
AdminApp -> ExpressBackend: POST /api/auth/login {password}
activate ExpressBackend
note over ExpressBackend: Verifikasi password terhadap salted bcrypt hash
ExpressBackend --> AdminApp: Return session token {token, role: 'admin'}\n(Status 200 OK)
deactivate ExpressBackend
AdminApp --> Admin: Masuk ke Dashboard Utama Admin
deactivate AdminApp

== 4. Unggah Gambar Media & Update Proyek / Studi Kasus ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Unggah screenshot proyek baru & isi studi kasus
activate AdminApp
AdminApp -> AdminAPI: POST /api/upload (multipart/form-data, max 10MB)
activate AdminAPI
AdminAPI -> StorageAPI: Simpan gambar ke bucket 'portfolio-assets'
activate StorageAPI
StorageAPI --> AdminAPI: Public CDN URL (https://...supabase.co/.../image.png)
deactivate StorageAPI
AdminAPI --> AdminApp: Return {url: "..."}
deactivate AdminAPI

AdminApp -> ExpressBackend: PUT /api/projects/:id/case-study\n{longDescription, highlights: [...], metrics, tags}
activate ExpressBackend
ExpressBackend -> DB: UPDATE projects SET longDescription, highlights...
activate DB
DB --> ExpressBackend: Status 200 OK
deactivate DB
ExpressBackend --> AdminApp: Response data proyek ter-update
AdminApp --> Admin: Toast notifikasi: "Studi kasus berhasil diperbarui!"
deactivate ExpressBackend

DB -> Realtime: Event TRIGGER (UPDATE projects)
Realtime -->> Web: Push payload data via WebSocket
Web --> User: Halaman web ter-update otomatis secara realtime (Tanpa refresh!)
deactivate AdminApp

== 5. Sinkronisasi Data Otomatis dari GitHub API ==
Admin -> AdminApp: Klik tombol "Sinkronkan dengan GitHub"
activate AdminApp
AdminApp -> GitHubAPI: GET https://api.github.com/users/moch-firmansyahh
AdminApp -> GitHubAPI: GET https://api.github.com/users/moch-firmansyahh/repos
activate GitHubAPI
GitHubAPI --> AdminApp: JSON repositori publik, stars, fork, bahasa pemrograman
deactivate GitHubAPI
AdminApp -> AdminApp: Komparasi repositori baru vs database
AdminApp --> Admin: Muncul dialog konfirmasi impor data GitHub
Admin -> AdminApp: Konfirmasi setuju impor
AdminApp -> ExpressBackend: POST /api/skills (Batch insert bahasa baru)
activate ExpressBackend
ExpressBackend -> DB: INSERT into "skills"
deactivate ExpressBackend
AdminApp --> Admin: Notifikasi "Sinkronisasi GitHub Berhasil"
deactivate AdminApp

@enduml
